      "slot": "s0",
      "source_id": "c1ceef31-5bf5-444a-b9f9-457384b8e12b",
      "text": "I think a general schedule would be easier to start with. Maybe something like checking each pot every two hours during the hottest part of the day? Does that sound reasonable?"
