      "available": true,
      "role": "model_output",
      "slot": "s1",
      "source_id": "cea084ec-c0fe-44ed-921f-4b61e33e22b5",
      "text": "That sounds like a solid, proactive approach! Checking every two hours during the peak heat of the day is definitely smart; it ensures you don't miss anything important while the sun is strongest. Do you want to track specific types of plants separately in that schedule, or are we looking for one general \"check-in\" time for the whole group?"
